  diseaseId: allergic_rhinitis
  diseaseName: "ALERJ\u0130K R\u0130N\u0130T"
  generalInfo: "Alerjik rinit, alerjenlere kar\u015F\u0131 geli\u015Fen bir \xFCst
    solunum yolu hastal\u0131\u011F\u0131d\u0131r. Hastalarda burun ak\u0131nt\u0131s\u0131,
    hap\u015F\u0131r\u0131k ve burun t\u0131kan\u0131kl\u0131\u011F\u0131 s\u0131k
    g\xF6r\xFClebilir."
  symptomsInfo: "Hafif burun ak\u0131nt\u0131s\u0131, burun t\u0131kan\u0131kl\u0131\u011F\u0131,
    ara s\u0131ra hap\u015F\u0131r\u0131k var olmas\u0131 ve hafif g\xF6z ka\u015F\u0131nt\u0131s\u0131
    alerjik rinitte s\u0131k g\xF6r\xFClen belirtilerdendir. Genellikle y\xFCksek
    ate\u015F g\xF6r\xFClmez."
  diagnosisTips: "Alerji bulgusu olmas\u0131, mevsimsel yak\u0131nmalar bulunmas\u0131
    ve \xFCst solunum belirtisi mevcut olmas\u0131 alerjik rinit tan\u0131s\u0131n\u0131
    destekleyebilir. Belirgin enfeksiyon bulgusu olmamas\u0131 ay\u0131r\u0131c\u0131
    tan\u0131da \xF6nemlidir."
  diseaseImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 191aac3ac38f4d343babb8a63a313415, type: 3}
